<h3>Speed-to-Lead</h3>
<p>Response time is the most underappreciated metric in contractor marketing. 78% of homeowners hire the first company that responds to them. Responding within 60 seconds increases conversion by 391%. Waiting 5+ minutes kills 80% of qualifying odds (PipelineOn 2026).</p>
<p><strong>Speed-to-Lead System:</strong><br />
1. Auto-responder email within 60 seconds of form submission<br />
2. Text message alert to sales team immediately<br />
3. Phone call within 5 minutes during business hours<br />
4. After-hours: automated text response with next-day appointment scheduling</p>
<h3>Monthly Optimization Routine</h3>
<p>Week 1 of each month:<br />
1. Review last month's metrics dashboard<br />
2. Identify top 3 lead sources by volume and by project value<br />
3. Identify bottom 3 sources — reduce or eliminate spend<br />
4. Review website conversion rates by landing page<br />
5. Update ad creative if CTR drops below 2%<br />
6. Add new portfolio projects and case studies<br />
7. Review and respond to all reviews from previous month</p>
<p>Quarterly:<br />
1. Audit Google Business Profile for accuracy<br />
2. Refresh location page content<br />
3. Review and update email nurture sequences<br />
4. Analyze proposal win/loss data for patterns<br />
5. Survey 3-5 recent clients for feedback on marketing touchpoints</p>
