<h3>Key Takeaways</h3>
<ol>
<li>
<p><strong>Market to your buyer, not to everyone.</strong> Residential and commercial prospects need completely different messaging, channels, and nurturing.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Your portfolio is your best salesperson.</strong> Document every project as a case study with Problem-Solution-Result format, metrics, and testimonials.</p>
</li>
<li>
